# ADR-0018 §2 — production is SAME-ORIGIN, so the SPA must carry no API origin.
#
# This file is committed on purpose and the value is intentionally empty. Vite
# loads `.env.production` for production builds only, and an empty value here
# overrides whatever a machine-local `apps/admin/.env` (gitignored) happens to
# hold — so a release build can never bake `http://localhost:3000`, or any other
# hostname, into the shipped artifact. Three consequences:
#
#   * axios resolves against the document origin (`src/lib/api.ts` baseURL is
#     empty, so it has no base and requests stay relative),
#   * the CSP that `vite.config.ts` injects keeps `connect-src 'self'` plus the
#     tile CDN, with no API-origin exception, and
#   * staging and production run the IDENTICAL image.
VITE_API_URL=
